<title>UK: SQUASH-JANSHER WINS BRITISH OPEN TITLE.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-JANSHER WINS BRITISH OPEN TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of British Open men's</p>
<p>final on Sunday:</p>
<p>Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Peter Nicol (Scotland) 17-15 9-15</p>
<p>15-12 8-15 15-8.</p>
